          %h2#Idea Idea
          %p
            What is called
            %em Hodge-filtered cohomogy
            \&amp;lbrack;
            %a{:href => "#HopkinsQuick14"}> Hopkins &amp; Quick (2014)
            \&amp;rbrack; is the variant of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+generalized+cohomology"} differential generalized cohomology
            obtained by passing from real
